    "(server has produced no output yet)": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "（服务器尚未产生任何输出）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "0 = deterministic greedy. 0.6–1.0 typical chat. Above 1.0 gets erratic. Applies to the app's chats immediately; also becomes the server default for external clients that omit temperature (Claude Code) after a restart.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "0 表示确定性的贪心解码。0.6–1.0 是常见的对话取值。超过 1.0 会变得不稳定。对应用内的对话立即生效；重启后也会成为未指定温度的外部客户端（如 Claude Code）的服务器默认值。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1. In Telegram, open @BotFather and send /newbot.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1. 在 Telegram 中打开 @BotFather 并发送 /newbot。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
