      }
    },
    "3D": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "3D"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "3D Generation — photo to mesh (Hunyuan3D 2.1)": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "3D 生成 — 照片转网格（Hunyuan3D 2.1）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "3D Model": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "3D 模型"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A capable everyday pick": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "称职的日常之选"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A clear step up in quality from E2B — better at longer conversations, writing, and coding — while still replying quickly. A great all-around default if you're not sure what to pick.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "质量比 E2B 明显更好 — 更擅长较长的对话、写作和编程 — 同时仍然回复迅速。如果不确定选哪个，它是很好的通用默认项。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A few seconds of clean speech works best. Answers are synthesized locally by the Audio pane's TTS model (downloaded on first use).": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "几秒钟清晰的语音效果最好。回答由音频面板的 TTS 模型在本地合成（首次使用时下载）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A frontier-scale DeepSeek model that runs natively on Apple Silicon through MLX — no GGUF conversion, no llama.cpp — for top-tier reasoning, coding, and agent work. It wakes only a fraction of itself per word (mixture of experts) and holds around a million words of context. This is our own mixed 2/3/8-bit conversion, about 118 GB on disk, so it wants a Mac with 128 GB of memory; it also ships DeepSeek's own DSpark draft stages, which Settings can switch on for a faster reply.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "前沿规模的 DeepSeek 模型，通过 MLX 在 Apple 芯片上原生运行 — 无需 GGUF 转换，也不用 llama.cpp — 提供顶级的推理、编程与智能体能力。它每个词只唤醒自身的一小部分（混合专家），并可容纳约一百万词的上下文。这是我们自己的 2/3/8 位混合转换版本，磁盘占用约 118 GB，因此需要 128 GB 内存的 Mac；它还附带 DeepSeek 自己的 DSpark 草稿阶段，可在设置中开启以加快回复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A goal the agent runs on its own, on a schedule.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "一个由智能体按计划自行执行的目标。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A memory-for-speed trade, not a free upgrade: shrinks KV-cache RAM (8-bit ≈ 2× smaller, 4-bit ≈ 4×) but makes decode ~10% slower at typical contexts — and slower still on long ones, since every generated token pays a dequantize step. Turn on when memory is the constraint (long contexts or big models on a 16 GB Mac); leave OFF for maximum tokens/sec if you have plenty of RAM. TurboQuant variants add a per-layer Hadamard rotation for heavy-tailed activations.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这是用速度换内存，而不是白得的提升：可减小 KV 缓存占用（8 位约小 2 倍，4 位约小 4 倍），但在常见上下文长度下解码约慢 10% — 上下文越长越慢，因为每生成一个 token 都要反量化一次。当内存是瓶颈时开启（长上下文，或在 16 GB 的 Mac 上跑大模型）；内存充裕、追求最高 token/秒时请保持关闭。TurboQuant 变体会为重尾激活额外做逐层 Hadamard 旋转。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A much larger model that uses a trick called “mixture of experts” — for every word it only wakes up a small part of itself, so it answers faster than you'd expect for its size while giving noticeably better answers than the smaller Gemma models.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "一个大得多的模型，它使用了称为“混合专家”的技巧 — 每个词只唤醒自身的一小部分，因此速度比同体量模型快得多，同时回答质量明显优于更小的 Gemma 模型。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A single, well-lit photo of one object works best. The subject is auto-cut from its background.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "单个物体、光线充足的照片效果最好。主体会自动从背景中抠出。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A well-rounded Qwen model — good at chatting, coding help, and following instructions, while staying quick to respond. A solid alternative to Gemma if you want to compare styles.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "一个全面的 Qwen 模型 — 擅长聊天、编程帮助和遵循指令，同时响应迅速。如果想比较不同风格，它是 Gemma 之外的可靠选择。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A well-rounded everyday assistant — good at chatting, answering questions, and simple coding help, while staying small and fast to run.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "一个全面的日常助手 — 擅长聊天、回答问题和简单的编程帮助，同时体积小、运行快。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ACE-Step 1.5 has no download yet — convert the weights on-device with tests/convert_acestep_weights.py (see the repo README). They install to ~/.mlx-serve/models/local/.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ACE-Step 1.5 暂无下载 —— 请用 tests/convert_acestep_weights.py 在本机转换权重（见仓库 README）。转换结果会安装到 ~/.mlx-serve/models/local/。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "API key": {
