    "Advertise this Mac over Bonjour and let other Macs on your local network run inference on the models you share below. Only inference is exposed — model management, metrics, and the status page stay private to this Mac.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "通过 Bonjour 广播这台 Mac，让局域网中的其他 Mac 使用你在下方共享的模型进行推理。仅开放推理 — 模型管理、指标和状态页面仍仅限本机访问。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After the shape stage, paint a full PBR texture (albedo + metallic-roughness) onto the mesh from the same photo. Needs the converted paint weights (~4.6 GB).": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在形状阶段之后，用同一张照片为网格绘制完整的 PBR 贴图（albedo + 金属度-粗糙度）。需要已转换的绘制权重（约 4.6 GB）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
