    "Big throughput wins on echo-heavy work; gates auto-disable on novel content. PLD, the drafter, and MTP are MLX-only — they no-op on GGUF / DSV4.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在大量重复内容的任务上吞吐提升明显；遇到全新内容时门控会自动关闭。PLD、草稿模型和 MTP 仅适用于 MLX — 在 GGUF / DSV4 上不起作用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Big, but efficient": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "体量大但高效"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bind address. 0.0.0.0 lets other devices on your network reach the server; 127.0.0.1 is local-only. The app itself connects via 127.0.0.1, so pick an address that includes localhost.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "绑定地址。0.0.0.0 允许网络中的其他设备访问此服务器；127.0.0.1 仅限本机。应用自身通过 127.0.0.1 连接，因此请选择包含 localhost 的地址。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
