    "Cap on candidate tokens per step. 0 = follow the model's own recommendation from generation_config.json (Qwen 3.6: 20, Gemma 4: 64); explicit values override it server-wide after a restart.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每一步候选 token 数的上限。0 表示遵循模型自己在 generation_config.json 中的推荐值（Qwen 3.6 为 20，Gemma 4 为 64）；显式设置的值在重启后会在整个服务器范围内覆盖它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
