    "Coerce tool-call arguments to the types the tool schema declares (e.g. a model sending Python's \"False\" or a list-as-string) so strict clients like Claude Code stop rejecting them with \"expected boolean, provided string\". Recommended on. Turn off to pass the model's arguments through exactly as written.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "把工具调用的参数强制转换为工具 schema 声明的类型（例如模型发出 Python 的 \"False\"，或把列表写成字符串），这样 Claude Code 等严格的客户端就不会再以 \"expected boolean, provided string\" 拒绝它们。建议开启。关闭后将原样传递模型写出的参数。"
          }
        }
      }
