    "Continuous batching: how many chat requests share one forward pass. 1 = serial. 2 is a good default for dense models (~1.5× throughput, ~33% per-request latency cost). MoE and hybrid SSM models stay serial regardless.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "连续批处理：多少个对话请求共享一次前向计算。1 表示串行。对稠密模型来说 2 是不错的默认值（吞吐约 1.5 倍，单请求延迟增加约 33%）。MoE 与混合 SSM 模型无论如何都保持串行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
