    "DeepSeek-V4 (ds4 engine)": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "DeepSeek-V4（ds4 引擎）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "DeepSeek‑V4‑Flash ships its own 3‑stage speculative draft (DSpark). Enabling it loads about 11 GB of extra draft weights at startup, so it stays off unless you turn it on — and the server still refuses when the Mac doesn't have the memory for model + draft + working room, serving normally instead. For DeepSeek‑V4 GGUF files this arms the embedded ds4 engine's DSpark runtime instead, using the DSpark support GGUF downloaded beside the model (nothing happens without that file). Only affects DeepSeek‑V4 models; greedy (temperature 0) requests only.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "DeepSeek‑V4‑Flash 自带 3 阶段推测草稿（DSpark）。启用后会在启动时额外加载约 11 GB 的草稿权重，因此默认关闭 — 而且当这台 Mac 的内存不足以容纳模型 + 草稿 + 运行余量时，服务器仍会拒绝加载并按普通方式提供服务。对于 DeepSeek‑V4 的 GGUF 文件，此项改为启用内置 ds4 引擎的 DSpark 运行时，使用与模型一同下载的 DSpark 支持 GGUF（没有该文件则不起作用）。仅影响 DeepSeek‑V4 模型；且仅用于贪心（温度为 0）的请求。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Default": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
