          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Deletes ALL sandbox data and returns it to factory state: the downloaded guest image and everything inside it (installed CLIs like pi/hermes, their configs and logins, any files created outside the shared workspace), the cached kernel, the sandbox ssh identity, and the activity transcript. Any running guest and live agent sessions are stopped immediately. Your workspace folder, models, and other app data on this Mac are not touched. The sandbox re-provisions itself on next use.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "删除全部沙盒数据并恢复出厂状态：已下载的客户机镜像及其中的一切（已安装的 pi/hermes 等命令行工具、它们的配置与登录信息，以及共享工作区之外创建的任何文件）、缓存的内核、沙盒的 ssh 身份，以及活动记录。正在运行的客户机和进行中的智能体会话会立即停止。你的工作区文件夹、模型和本机上的其他应用数据不受影响。沙盒会在下次使用时重新配置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Demo unavailable in this build.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此版本不提供演示。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Denoising steps. More = more detail and smoother motion, but slower.": {
