    "Guidance (%@)": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "引导强度（%1$@）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Guidance strength — how closely the video follows your prompt. 1.0 = off: fastest and most natural-looking. Higher sticks to the prompt more strictly but is slower and can look over-saturated. LTX default is 3.0.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "引导强度 —— 视频与提示词的贴合程度。1.0 = 关闭：最快，画面也最自然。数值越高越严格贴合提示词，但速度更慢，画面可能过饱和。LTX 默认值为 3.0。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "HTTP": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
