    "Host": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "主机地址"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hot prefix cache size: how many separate KV snapshots to keep across requests. Lets multi-turn chats skip re-prefilling shared system prompts. 0 disables. Auto-capped on RAM-limited Macs (a 16 GB Mac caps to 1) — on hybrid SSM models each entry pins large KV + state snapshots that can otherwise fill memory.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "热前缀缓存大小：跨请求保留多少份独立的 KV 快照。可让多轮对话跳过重复的系统提示预填充。0 表示禁用。在内存有限的 Mac 上会自动限制（16 GB 的 Mac 限制为 1）— 在混合 SSM 模型上，每个条目都会占用较大的 KV 与状态快照，否则可能占满内存。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How can I help you today?": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "今天有什么可以帮你的？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How large each reference image is fed to the model. Maximum detail keeps identity better and is several times slower — every reference token is re-read on every sampling step.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每张参考图送入模型的尺寸。最高细节能更好地保持人物一致性，但会慢上数倍 —— 每个采样步都要重新读取全部参考 token。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How many independent llama.cpp KV contexts to keep resident. 1 = legacy single-session (every flip between long prompts evicts the other). >1 keeps the N most-recently-used prompts hot — alternating multi-doc workloads stop cold-prefilling on every flip.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保留多少个独立的 llama.cpp KV 上下文。1 表示旧的单会话模式（在两段长提示之间来回切换时会互相淘汰）。大于 1 时会保留最近使用的 N 段提示 — 在多文档来回切换的场景下不必每次都冷预填充。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How many times this repo has been pulled from HuggingFace": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这个仓库从 HuggingFace 被拉取的次数"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How many tokens the MTP head guesses per step. Automatic (recommended) tunes this live — it guesses deeper while the model keeps accepting the guesses and backs off when it doesn't. Pick a fixed number only if you're measuring performance.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MTP 头每一步猜测的 token 数量。自动（推荐）会实时调整 — 模型持续接受猜测时就猜得更深，否则回退。只有在做性能测量时才需要选择固定值。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hugging Face Cache": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hugging Face 缓存"
