            "value": "指标面板"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mixture-of-experts models (e.g. Qwen3.6 35B-A3B) leave their MTP head switched off by default, because checking several guessed tokens at once makes them re-route every expert and that can cost more than it saves. Some MoE heads are good enough to win anyway. Turn this on to use it — and measure: if replies get slower, turn it back off. Models without an MoE layout are unaffected.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "混合专家模型（如 Qwen3.6 35B-A3B）默认关闭 MTP 头，因为一次校验多个猜测 token 会让每个专家重新路由，代价可能超过收益。有些 MoE 的 MTP 头依然足够好。开启即可使用 — 并请实测：如果回复变慢，就再关掉。非 MoE 结构的模型不受影响。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
