        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无（应用默认）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "None loaded — models load on demand": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未加载 —— 模型会按需加载"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "None — voice mode uses the system voice.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无 —— 语音模式将使用系统声音。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Not downloaded": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未下载"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Noticeably better at following detailed, multi-step instructions and reasoning through trickier problems than the smaller Gemma models, without needing a huge amount of memory.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在遵循复杂的多步指令和推理较难的问题上明显优于更小的 Gemma 模型，而且不需要占用大量内存。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nucleus sampling threshold. 0.95 keeps all but the long tail. 1.0 disables top-p filtering. Also the server default for external clients that omit top_p (restart needed for that part).": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "核采样阈值。0.95 会保留除长尾之外的全部候选。1.0 表示关闭 top-p 过滤。它同时是未指定 top_p 的外部客户端的服务器默认值（该部分需重启生效）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "OFF": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已关闭"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "OFF = plain chat (safe). ON = the bot can run shell commands and read/write files on this Mac, triggered from your phone. Confined to ~/.mlx-serve/telegram-workspace. Only enable if you understand the risk — anyone who can message the locked chat gets this power.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关闭时只是普通对话（安全）。开启后，机器人可以从你的手机触发，在这台 Mac 上执行终端命令并读写文件。操作被限制在 ~/.mlx-serve/telegram-workspace 内。请在了解风险后再启用 — 任何能给该会话发消息的人都将拥有这项权限。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "OFF = the agent runs shell commands directly on macOS (fast, full access to your files). ON = commands run inside an isolated Linux sandbox that can only touch the current working folder, so a bad command can't harm the rest of your Mac. Costs a bit more memory while active because it spins up a lightweight virtual machine for the session.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关闭时，智能体直接在 macOS 上执行终端命令（速度快，可访问你的全部文件）。开启后，命令在隔离的 Linux 沙盒中运行，只能访问当前工作文件夹，因此一条有害命令伤不到 Mac 的其余部分。启用期间会多占用一些内存，因为它会为该会话启动一台轻量虚拟机。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "OK": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "好"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ON": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ON = the sandbox has outbound internet (NAT), and any server the agent starts inside it is automatically reachable on this Mac at localhost with the same port — e.g. a dev server on 8080 appears at localhost:8080 (bound to localhost only, never your LAN). OFF = the sandbox gets no network device at all: fully isolated, but installs and downloads inside it will fail. Applies to the next sandbox session.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开启后，沙盒可以对外联网（NAT），并且智能体在其中启动的任何服务都会以相同端口自动映射到本机的 localhost — 例如运行在 8080 的开发服务器可通过 localhost:8080 访问（仅绑定到本机，绝不暴露到局域网）。关闭后沙盒完全没有网络设备：彻底隔离，但其中的安装和下载都会失败。将在下一个沙盒会话生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ON = tools are opt-in: a chat only gets them when you turn the wrench (or MCP) on yourself, and sending a message that looks like a task — \"make me a website\", \"npm install react\" — no longer stops to ask whether to enable Tools or MCP first. OFF = that suggestion still appears before such a message is sent. Either way the toolbar toggles, and any agent that decides them for its tab, are unchanged.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开启后工具改为按需启用：只有你自己打开扳手（或 MCP）时，该对话才会获得工具；发送看起来像任务的消息 —“帮我做个网站”“npm install react”— 也不会再先询问是否启用工具或 MCP。关闭时，这类消息发送前仍会出现该提示。无论哪种方式，工具栏上的开关，以及为所在标签页决定这些设置的智能体，都不受影响。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ON in another chat — click to move it here": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已在其他对话中开启 —— 点击可移到这里"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ON in this chat": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已在此对话中开启"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off (default): the fast recipe — step caching + attention reuse, about 2.8x faster at 768p. On: every denoising step is fully computed; marginally better detail for final renders.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关（默认）：快速方案 —— 步缓存 + 注意力复用，在 768p 下约快 2.8 倍。开：每个去噪步都完整计算；最终成片的细节略好一些。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off (default): the plain convolutional decoder. On: LTX's own diffusion decoder — the one their published clips use. It denoises the frames instead of interpolating them, so fine texture and edges come out sharper. The decode itself takes about 21 s for a 97-frame clip at 768x512; measured end to end against the plain decoder in the same session the difference was inside run-to-run variance.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关（默认）：普通卷积解码器。开：LTX 自家的扩散解码器 —— 他们公开的片段用的就是它。它对帧做去噪而不是插值，因此细腻纹理和边缘更锐利。在 768x512 下解码一段 97 帧的片段本身约需 21 秒；在同一次会话中与普通解码器做端到端对比，差异仍在运行间波动范围之内。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On (default): generated images are screened by an on-device NSFW classifier and explicit results are blocked. Off: no filtering — you are responsible for the output.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开（默认）：生成的图像会由本机 NSFW 分类器筛查，露骨结果会被拦截。关：不做过滤 —— 输出内容由你自行负责。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On This Mac": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在这台 Mac 上"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On Your Network": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在你的局域网中"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On this Mac": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在这台 Mac 上"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On: the model stays resident so the next generation is instant. Off (default): it's unloaded to free GPU memory.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开：模型保持常驻，下一次生成可立即开始。关（默认）：卸载模型以释放 GPU 内存。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One of the most capable models this app can run — excellent at coding and at multi-step “agent” tasks like using tools and following a plan, and it reads images too. It also ships with a built-in speed trick that lets it draft and double-check several words at once, so it feels noticeably faster than a plain model this size.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本应用能运行的最强模型之一 — 在编程以及使用工具、按计划行事这类多步“智能体”任务上表现出色，还能读取图片。它还自带一项加速机制，可以一次起草并校验多个词，因此比同体量的普通模型明显更快。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One of the strongest models here": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这里最强的模型之一"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only use tools when I ask": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅在我要求时使用工具"
          }
        }
      }
