    },
    "Persist seen KV prefixes to disk (~/.mlx-serve/kv-cache) so they survive restarts + RAM evictions — turns a cold 30-50s long-context first-token wait into a fast SSD read. OFF by default because it can use many gigabytes of disk.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "把出现过的 KV 前缀持久化到磁盘（~/.mlx-serve/kv-cache），使其在重启和内存淘汰后依然可用 — 把长上下文冷启动 30-50 秒的首字等待变成一次快速的 SSD 读取。默认关闭，因为它可能占用数十 GB 磁盘空间。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
