    "Privacy: prompts sent to a model you share are processed on — and visible to — this Mac. Prompts you send to a network model are visible to the Mac hosting it. Traffic stays on your local network, and everything here is off unless you turn it on.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "隐私说明：发给你所共享模型的提示词会在这台 Mac 上处理，并对这台 Mac 可见。你发给局域网模型的提示词，对承载该模型的 Mac 可见。流量仅在你的局域网内传输，且这里的所有功能默认关闭，需你手动开启。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Product close-up": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
