    "Prompt": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "提示词"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Prompt Lookup Decoding. Big wins on echo-heavy workloads (code editing, RAG, agent loops). The adaptive prompt-time gate auto-disables it on novel content. On models with a native MTP head, MTP takes priority and PLD stays dormant — except MoE models (e.g. 35B-A3B), where PLD is the default speedup.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "提示查找解码（PLD）。在大量重复内容的任务上收益显著（代码编辑、RAG、智能体循环）。自适应门控会在内容全新时自动关闭它。对于自带 MTP 头的模型，MTP 优先，PLD 保持休眠 — MoE 模型（如 35B-A3B）除外，那里 PLD 才是默认的加速手段。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
