    "Stopped — the model started repeating itself and the server cut the reply. Try rephrasing, or ask for a smaller piece of the task.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已停止 — 模型开始重复自己，服务器中断了这次回复。可以换一种问法，或让它先做任务中更小的一部分。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stream DeepSeek-V4-Flash expert weights from SSD instead of holding the whole model in RAM (skips full residency + warmup). Turn on when the model is larger than available memory — it loads instead of OOMing, trading some decode speed for the disk reads. ds4 / DeepSeek-V4-Flash only; ignored by the MLX and llama.cpp engines. Passes --ssd-streaming.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "从 SSD 流式读取 DeepSeek-V4-Flash 的专家权重，而不是把整个模型放在内存中（跳过完整驻留与预热）。当模型大于可用内存时开启 — 这样它能加载成功而不是内存溢出，代价是用磁盘读取换取部分解码速度。仅适用于 ds4 / DeepSeek-V4-Flash；MLX 与 llama.cpp 引擎会忽略。对应 --ssd-streaming。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
