    "Tencent's flagship open model — 295 billion parameters, of which it wakes only 21 billion per word (mixture of experts). Top-tier reasoning, agent work, and tool use, entirely on your Mac. This is the full model stored compactly (importance-calibrated 2-bit), so on a 128 GB Mac it runs with a genuinely usable context window rather than just a few sentences. Best on Macs with 128 GB of memory or more.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "腾讯的旗舰开源模型 — 2950 亿参数，每个词只唤醒其中的 210 亿（混合专家）。顶级的推理、智能体与工具使用能力，全部在你的 Mac 上运行。这是以紧凑方式存储的完整模型（按重要性校准的 2 位量化），因此在 128 GB 的 Mac 上能拥有真正可用的上下文窗口，而不只是几句话。建议在 128 GB 及以上内存的 Mac 上使用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
