    },
    "The best this app offers": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本应用中最好的选择"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The biggest model here": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这里最大的模型"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The default working folder for the agent's tools (shell, readFile, writeFile, …) in every chat — and the folder shared into the sandbox VM at /workspace while the sandbox is on. Changing it moves chats still on the previous default, remounts a running sandbox, and restarts any open terminal sessions in the new folder; a chat with its own picked folder (the folder icon on the Agent pill) keeps it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "所有对话中，智能体工具（终端、读文件、写文件……）默认使用的工作文件夹 — 在沙盒开启时，它也会以 /workspace 的形式共享进沙盒虚拟机。更改它会一并迁移仍在使用旧默认值的对话、重新挂载运行中的沙盒，并让已打开的终端会话在新文件夹中重启；已自行选择文件夹的对话（智能体胶囊上的文件夹图标）保持不变。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The edit comes back at the source image's own size.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "编辑结果会以源图像本身的尺寸返回。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The highest-quality model on this list: Gemma's largest model at full 8-bit precision. This is about as good as local answers get here — save it for when quality matters more than speed.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "列表中质量最高的模型：以完整 8 位精度运行的 Gemma 最大模型。这基本上是本地能得到的最好效果 — 当质量比速度更重要时再用它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The model invents a soundtrack from your prompt. Attach speech to make characters say exact words.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "模型会根据你的提示词自行创作配乐。附加语音可让角色说出指定台词。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The name other Macs see next to your shared models. Blank = this Mac's hostname.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "其他 Mac 在你共享的模型旁看到的名称。留空则使用本机主机名。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The same Gemma mixture-of-experts model as above, stored with twice the numeric precision (8-bit instead of 4-bit). That means slightly more accurate, consistent answers, at roughly double the memory.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "与上面相同的 Gemma 混合专家模型，但以两倍的数值精度存储（8 位而非 4 位）。这意味着回答略微更准确、更稳定，代价是内存占用大约翻倍。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server isn't running — the task will start it on its first run.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "服务器未运行 —— 任务会在首次运行时自动启动它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The session running inside the sandbox will be terminated. Files it wrote are kept.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "沙盒中正在运行的会话将被终止。它写入的文件会保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The smaller Laguna, same specialty: writing and editing code and multi-step “agent” work like using tools across a project. A 33-billion-parameter mixture-of-experts model in poolside's own 4-bit NVFP4 build, and the fastest coding model in this list: about 121 tokens per second on an M4 Max. Fits a 32 GB Mac.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "更小的 Laguna，专长相同：编写和修改代码，以及在整个项目中使用工具这类多步“智能体”工作。这是一个 330 亿参数的混合专家模型，采用 poolside 自己的 4 位 NVFP4 构建，也是列表中最快的编程模型：在 M4 Max 上约每秒 121 个 token。32 GB 的 Mac 即可运行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The sweet spot": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "最佳平衡点"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The task run failed.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这次任务运行失败。"
