    "Top-p": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Top-p"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Total RAM the server will hold in loaded models before it evicts one — or refuses the load when there is nothing to evict. Auto = 80% of what Metal recommends for this Mac. Raise it when a model you know fits is refused with \"not enough memory\" on an idle server; the refusal in the log names the estimate it used. Passes --max-resident-mem.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "服务器为已加载模型保留的内存总量，超过后会淘汰其中一个 — 若无可淘汰的模型，则拒绝本次加载。自动 = Metal 为这台 Mac 推荐值的 80%。如果空闲的服务器以“内存不足”拒绝了你确信放得下的模型，可以调高它；日志中的拒绝信息会说明所用的估算值。对应 --max-resident-mem。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Transcript of reference (optional)": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "参考音频的文字稿（可选）"
          }
        }
      }
