        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Turbo 需要一个 %1$lld MB 的适配器，而这个模型包发布得更早 —— 它只会下载一次，“生成”会等它完成。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turbo runs on the Mac hosting this model; it needs the adapter in ITS copy of the pack.": {
