    "Write the server log to ~/.mlx-serve/logs/mlx-serve-<port>.log (32 MB rotation, one file per port). This is the file to check after a crash — the in-app log viewer only holds what arrived while the app was running.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将服务器日志写入 ~/.mlx-serve/logs/mlx-serve-<port>.log（32 MB 轮转，每个端口一个文件）。崩溃后应查看这个文件 — 应用内的日志查看器只保留应用运行期间收到的内容。"
          }
