        }
      }
    },
    "llama.cpp's KV-quant scheme (ggml Q8_0 / Q4_0). Same trade as the MLX version: less KV RAM, slower decode — leave off for maximum tokens/sec if you have plenty of RAM. Distinct kernels from the MLX KV-quant; auto-enables flash-attn on the server side when non-default.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "llama.cpp 的 KV 量化方案（ggml Q8_0 / Q4_0）。与 MLX 版本的权衡相同：KV 内存更小，解码更慢 — 内存充裕、追求最高 token/秒时请保持关闭。它与 MLX 的 KV 量化使用不同的内核；设为非默认值时会在服务端自动启用 flash-attn。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "malformed": {
