          }
        }
      }
    },
    "poolside's full-size coding specialist, built for writing and editing code and for multi-step “agent” work like using tools across a whole project. A large mixture-of-experts model — 117 billion parameters in total, but only about 8.5 billion wake up per word — in poolside's own 4-bit NVFP4 build, the quantization the model ships in. Needs a Mac with a lot of memory; the XS above covers smaller machines.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "poolside 的完整版编程专用模型，用于编写和修改代码，以及在整个项目中使用工具这类多步“智能体”工作。这是一个大型混合专家模型 — 总参数 1170 亿，但每个词只唤醒约 85 亿 — 采用 poolside 自己的 4 位 NVFP4 构建，也是该模型发布时的量化格式。需要内存充足的 Mac；内存较小的机器请选择上面的 XS。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "random": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "随机"
          }
        }
      }
    },
